Id: pass020w
Severity: WARN
Category: accounts
Check: check_passwdspec
Controls: CIS 5.2; NIST IA-5(1); ISO 5.17; CE User access control

The account's password hash is in /etc/passwd rather than /etc/shadow,
so every user can read it and crack it offline. Run pwconv to move all
hashes into the shadow file.
